            {
              "id": "1768199857241_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an agent trying to extract data from a document given to you as a textualized content that represents a target business objects with a set of attributes per business objects and related objects.\nThe business objects represented in the document are listed below:\n=== TARGET BUSINESS OBJECTS ===\n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.targetBusinessObject}} \nTarget business objects can be related to each other.\nThe target business object themselves are relational in nature with the following cardinality variations.\n  1-1 (One-to-One)\n  1-* (One-to-Many)\nThe list of target business objects and their relations and cardinality are described below like a tree with each node in a level represented by |--\n=== TARGET BUSINESS OBJECT HIERARCHY & CARDINALITY ===\n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.targetBusinessObjectHierarchyAndCardinality}} \nThe list of attributes and what they mean for each businessObject is provied below. A nested business object is represented like a path.\nA 1-* related object is represented via a \"items\" sub path\n=== TARGET BUSINESS OBJECT ATTRIBUTE AND DESCRIPTIONS ===\n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.targetBusinessObjectAttributesAndDescriptions}}\nThe textual document represents the above target business objects even though the attributes in the document are not exactly named as the above and can have alternate conventions.\n=== SAMPLE PAYLOAD FORMAT===\n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.samplePayloadFormat}}\nBased on what is stated above extract the data from the textual content below as JSON in the samplePayload format described above.\nIf a value for any field can not be found use the DEFAULT VALUES listed above to default a value. If there is none default to null.\nThe document textual content is:\n{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.documentTextualContent}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        }
